<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE TRADE RESTARTED, DEALERS SAY.</title>
<headline>BOURSE TRADE RESTARTED, DEALERS SAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn bourse restarted trade at 1225 after it stopped at 1100, dealers said.</p>
<p>The bourse had been hit by more technical problems after trade was halted for several hours on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
